 ### Standalone account cards
 
 First-run setup uses `Panel shape="card"`, matching Builderlab/Auth0: content-sized, `radius-card` corners and `shadow-card` lift. Compose a 490px reading column with space-8 insets, title/body-sm typography, shared Field/Input controls and large capsule actions. Keep welcome artwork separate from these opaque setup cards.
+
+### Recent chat rows
+
+Use `NavigationItem variant="conversation" multiline` for a recent-chat inventory with a 40px avatar, name, preview, timestamp, and unread metadata. This shares the row's keyboard, hover, selection and focus owner; the feature supplies content and recency ordering. `row` remains the compact channel-directory treatment.
+
+`Panel shape="flat"` composes continuous IM application regions without a border,
+corner or elevation. Its parent supplies the common background. Use the ordinary
+panel shape for independently floating or nested task surfaces.
